  "title": "Slow-Cooked Garlic Confit",
  "description": "If garlic is slow-cooked and preserved as confit, essentially stored in fat, the garlic flavor intensifies, bringing out the natural sweetness and taming the strong bite.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-10-30T02:52:52-04:00",
